        "sub": "{E5_SILL_DEFECT}",
        "text": "Sill defect: The windowsill projection beyond the face of the wall does not appear to be {SILL_DEFECTS}. This is allowing water ingress to adjoining walls and may be causing dampness. You should promptly arrange for further investigation and repair by a qualified professional to prevent further damage.",
